    {
      "parameters": {
        "text": "=Job title: {{ $json.title }}\nCompany: {{ $json.company }}\nLocation: {{ $json.location }}\nSummary: {{ $json.summary }}",
        "schemaType": "fromJson",
        "jsonSchemaExample": "{ \"score\": 8, \"reason\": \"Junior AI role in Karachi that matches Python and LLM skills.\" }",
        "options": {
          "systemPromptTemplate": "You score how well a job fits the candidate below, using only the job details given.\nFollow the scoring guide exactly. Give the reason in one short sentence.\n\nCANDIDATE PROFILE: Hafsa Noor\n\nTARGET ROLES (best fit first):\nAI Engineer Intern, Junior AI Engineer, AI Automation Engineer,\nData Science Intern, other Computer Science / software internships.\nAlso: business development roles at software houses or tech companies,\nonly if they are not sales-focused.\n\nLOCATION: Karachi (on-site or hybrid), or fully remote.\n\nEXPERIENCE: Fresh graduate (BSCS, University of Karachi, 2025).\nAbout 3 years of remote customer support experience.\nRoles must ask for 2 years of experience or less.\n\nSTRONG SKILLS: Python, SQL, PostgreSQL, Pandas, NumPy, Scikit-learn,\nLLM APIs (Groq), prompt engineering, structured output (Pydantic),\ntext-to-SQL, Whisper, n8n automation, Git, Streamlit.\n\nLEARNING: RAG, embeddings, vector databases, LangChain, FastAPI, Docker.\n\nNOT INTERESTED: senior, lead or principal roles; roles needing more than\n2 years of experience; sales-focused roles; pure MERN/frontend; .NET/ERP.\n\nDEAL-BREAKER: relocation. Jobs outside Karachi that are not remote score 1-2.\nSCORING GUIDE:\n9-10 = target role, junior level, location fits, skills match well.\n6-8  = related role, or a good match with one gap.\n3-5  = a stretch: more experience asked, weak skill match, or relocation.\n1-2  = senior role, more than 2 years required, sales-focused, or requires relocation."
        }
      },
